  "features": [
    "Start reserves exclusivity synchronously and revalidates the eight existing readiness checks, fresh explicit per-audit consent, exact target/model, current key revision and capability attestation before native session/Utility activation.",
    "A serialized ToolLoopAgent observes actual page state, updates an evidence-linked plan, invokes general semantic browser tools, asks structured questions and finishes only through validated terminal tools/conditions. No hidden reasoning is streamed.",
    "Ordered UUID/sequence/timestamp events with immutable prefixes and full-state replay; safe operational details only. Stable TODOs use pending/in-progress/completed/blocked/skipped and require successful browser references for completion.",
    "Single/multiple-choice, free text and masked sensitive input; trusted answer validation, stale/duplicate rejection, declared Skip only, minimize/persistent Answer Pending action and no generic composer.",
    "Sensitive answers become Main-owned one-use references bound to audit, native generation and exact leased fill target. Raw answers do not enter model input, events, TODOs, checkpoints or reports. Stored provider keys never return to Renderer.",
    "Take Control excludes new actions and waits for a safe checkpoint. Return disables manual input and reinspects before waking planning. Stale crash-time continuations cannot silently reclaim ownership; User intent/control decisions survive bounded recovery.",
    "Main enforces origin/generation/ownership/action leases and consumes exact one-operation approvals. Known destructive/financial URLs/actions and credential-bearing GET URLs are denied. Unknown writes are blocked; a declared local form can receive one exact method/endpoint allowance.",
    "If the native guard blocks a request during an action, the result reports policy-blocked rather than successful intended effects. Unknown action outcomes are not automatically replayed.",
    "One bounded Main-owned checkpoint retains current/last real progress. Incomplete restart becomes inert Interrupted with no pending question or automatic execution. Full history and independently verified findings remain Slice 4."
  ],
